epo": "kotlin-react-bootstrap", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "569d23447a34f9b8c8b6ecc5af1cf3bc19c7578e", "message": "wrapper update", "created_at": "2020-07-21T11:22:58Z", "repo": "kotlin-react-bootstrap", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "199df6be29c150ea3e461c0cb531509a6330a4da", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2020-05-26T22:09:47Z", "repo": "kotlin-react-bootstrap", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f9c99260ce1aa8da6ca6353cbf7428c4ac758e0a", "message": "Seal up ColAttributes (#30)\n\n- change ColAttributes into a sealed class\r\n- improve usability by adding some smart companion object vals\r\n- seal up row. move col, row and container in their own package. add container builder", "created_at": "2020-05-18T10:26:31Z", "repo": "kotlin-react-bootstrap", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cf725f56a3a1431c549c18d16e22bc65fb7a0cd6", "message": "Minor fixes and improvements (#29)\n\n* update to 104 wrappers. try to use commonJs. use main container just like the orig docs\r\n* Fixes #8. Scroll to top after route change\r\n* Fixes #1 favicon is now loaded via webpack", "created_at": "2020-05-14T09:20:09Z", "repo": "kotlin-react-bootstrap", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7b09e1b63d439f81b3f0c04661c9c3723efe966c", "message": "Documentation update", "created_at": "2020-05-10T22:19:38Z", "repo": "kotlin-react-bootstrap", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "509903271201c9ffd0997a3a1a6dcf239bcab125", "message": "use markdown-to-jsx instead of custom formattedText", "created_at": "2020-05-10T16:16:53Z", "repo": "kotlin-react-bootstrap", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f664dd0beffa4a6cdb86c99d7d7c362071e7146a", "message": "Code Example Overhaul and Cleanup (#14)\n\n- new typealias RDOMHandler respective to RHandler\r\n- rename WithRDOMBuilderBlock to WithRDOMHandler and rename the field to `handler`.\r\n- move kt extension functions into documentation\r\n- fix indent on a alot of multiline strings\r\n- rename example {} to liveExample {}\r\n- rename codeBox {} to codeExample {}\r\n- new helper function to create imports in code example\r\n- new helper function to create inline blocks in code example\r\n- rename ktBlock to ktB\r\n- use it instead of il in code examples\r\n- improve ktB function to automate more stuff\r\n- more type safe fun reference printer\r\n- simplify code doc page\r\n- move page related helpers to the pages", "created_at": "2020-05-10T13:49:54Z", "repo": "kotlin-react-bootstrap", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bebeeb15d3ee7d23fd558aba54108e83b2a3f009", "message": "lint", "created_at": "2020-05-08T23:00:25Z", "repo": "kotlin-react-bootstrap", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "78b6a0a1633f1f817479b807c85cc2331035c042", "message": "Documentation update", "created_at": "2020-05-08T12:16:52Z", "repo": "kotlin-react-bootstrap", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "823dfbe557a8159caa3472bed74e37f1aa8d180a", "message": "Alert Component (#10)\n\n- add close component, since its needed for alerts\r\n- more dismissing examples\r\n- added `ariaLabel` ext val\r\n- added `ariaHidden` ext val\r\n- bundle RProps\r\n- bundle type aliases\r\n- make close button customizable in alert\r\n- added callback onClose and onClosed\r\n- enable fading of alert\r\n- add Reference to alert documentation page\r\n- make link and heading functions more flexible\r\n- added some Kdoc", "created_at": "2020-05-08T12:14:28Z", "repo": "kotlin-react-bootstrap", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e5f3dc5065a4416887a807d01cb42f6718ca7597", "message": "make section nav work", "created_at": "2020-05-05T13:20:23Z", "repo": "kotlin-react-bootstrap", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f4994b28f96793fdddf2b10f1b422c78d24618f2", "message": "Documentation update", "created_at": "2020-05-05T13:06:52Z", "repo": "kotlin-react-bootstrap", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}], "prs": [{"created_at": "2020-11-10T11:45:07Z", "body_length": 875}, {"created_at": "2020-11-08T21:54:11Z", "body_length": 46}, {"created_at": "2020-11-03T13:53:49Z", "body_length": 74}, {"created_at": "2020-11-02T21:09:33Z", "body_length": 330}, {"created_at": "2020-10-16T12:57:04Z", "body_length": 650}, {"created_at": "2020-10-14T20:31:58Z", "body_length": 517}, {"created_at": "2020-10-09T13:18:32Z", "body_length": 256}, {"created_at": "2020-07-31T11:20:29Z", "body_length": 212}, {"created_at": "2020-07-28T21:15:23Z", "body_length": 118}, {"created_at": "2020-05-14T10:52:36Z", "body_length": 195}, {"created_at": "2020-05-14T09:17:06Z", "body_length": 21}, {"created_at": "2020-05-10T22:17:22Z", "body_length": 361}, {"created_at": "2020-05-10T13:48:49Z", "body_length": 649}, {"created_at": "2020-05-07T22:16:28Z", "body_length": 356}]}